 In <i>Stochastic Differential Systems Stochastic Control Theory and Their Applications<\/i> 147\u2013186. Springer, New York.","DOI":"10.1007\/978-1-4613-8762-6_11"},{"key":"21","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Ishii, H. and Koike, S. (1983). Boundary regularity and uniqueness for an elliptic equation with gradient constraint. <i>Comm. Partial Differential Equations<\/i> <b>8<\/b> 317\u2013346.","DOI":"10.1080\/03605308308820271"},{"key":"22","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Ishii, H. and Loreti, P. (2002). A class of optimal control problems with state constraint. <i>Indiana Univ. Math. J.<\/i> <b>51<\/b> 1167\u20131196.","DOI":"10.1512\/iumj.2002.51.2079"},{"key":"23","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Karatzas, I. (1983). A class of singular stochastic control problems. <i>Adv. in Appl. Probab.<\/i> <b>15<\/b> 225\u2013254.","DOI":"10.1017\/S0001867800021169"},{"key":"25","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Katsoulakis, M. A. (1994). Viscosity solutions of second order fully nonlinear elliptic equations with state constraints. <i>Indiana Univ. Math. J.<\/i> <b>43<\/b> 493\u2013519.","DOI":"10.1512\/iumj.1994.43.43020"},{"key":"26","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Lasry, J. M. and Lions, P. L. (1989). Nonlinear elliptic equations with singular boundary conditions and stochastic control with state constraints. I. The model problem. <i>Math. Ann.<\/i> <b>283<\/b> 583\u2013630.","DOI":"10.1007\/BF01442856"},{"key":"27","unstructured":"Lions, P. L. (1982). <i>Generalized solutions of Hamilton\u2013Jacobi Equations<\/i>. Pitman, Boston."},{"key":"28","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Martins, L. F., Shreve, S. E. and Soner, H. M. (1996). Heavy traffic convergence of a controlled multi-class queuing system. <i>SIAM J. Control. Optim.<\/i> <b>34<\/b> 2133\u20132171.","DOI":"10.1137\/S0363012994265882"},{"key":"29","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","unstructured":"Menaldi, J. L. and Robin, M. (1983). On 